      "name": "Rain",
      "slug": "rain",
      "category": "Overview",
      "type": null,
      "requirementCost": null,
      "costRequirement": null,
      "requirements": null,
      "cost": null,
      "benefits": null,
      "reason": null,
      "notes": null,
      "description": "Rain occurs occasionally at random times. If the player is under a building or roof, they will not see the rain. Rain consists of Roblox particles spread across the map. During rain, the sky turns gray and appears darker than usual.",
      "descriptionNotes": null,
      "building": null,
      "wikiUrl": null,
      "image": "/Brookhaven%20RP/Weather%20and%20Disasters/rain.webp",
      "sourceImageUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/official-brookhaven/images/7/77/WeatherEffect_%284%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20260125123740"
    },
    {
      "number": "2",
      "name": "Flood",
      "slug": "flood",
      "category": "Overview",
      "type": null,
      "requirementCost": null,
      "costRequirement": null,
      "requirements": null,
      "cost": null,
      "benefits": null,
      "reason": null,
      "notes": null,
      "description": "Occasionally, rain may cause floods. Floods are similar to rain but feature non-collidable, dirty, mud-colored water. Players may hear ambient thunder or lightning sounds. The sky turns gray and appears darker than usual during a flood.",
      "descriptionNotes": null,
      "building": null,
      "wikiUrl": null,
      "image": "/Brookhaven%20RP/Weather%20and%20Disasters/flood.webp",
      "sourceImageUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/official-brookhaven/images/f/f0/WeatherEffect_%283%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20260125123740"
    },
    {
      "number": "3",
      "name": "Snow",
      "slug": "snow",
      "category": "Overview",
      "type": null,
      "requirementCost": null,
      "costRequirement": null,
      "requirements": null,
      "cost": null,
      "benefits": null,
      "reason": null,
      "notes": null,
      "description": "Snow typically appears in winter but was discontinued in early 2025 due to extended duration. In December 2025, snow was updated: previously resembling white rain particles in a specific direction, it became smaller and less visible, likely due to Roblox scaling. The snow texture changed from smooth plastic to a custom texture that did not fit the map, and was later removed in early 2026. The new snow also enters buildings, unlike the older version. Snow on the ground appears, and vacant plots change grass color accordingly. The sky turns gray and appears darker than usual.",
      "descriptionNotes": null,
      "building": null,
      "wikiUrl": null,
      "image": "/Brookhaven%20RP/Weather%20and%20Disasters/snow.webp",
      "sourceImageUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/official-brookhaven/images/b/bd/WeatherEffect_%282%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20260125123739"
    },
    {
      "number": "4",
      "name": "Snow on Ground",
      "slug": "snow-on-ground",
      "category": "Overview",
      "type": null,
      "requirementCost": null,
      "costRequirement": null,
      "requirements": null,
      "cost": null,
      "benefits": null,
      "reason": null,
      "notes": null,
      "description": "Snow on the ground replaces dirty flood water with white snow. Unlike snow, there is no snowfall during snow-on-ground events. This effect was discontinued in May 2025 due to extended duration. The sky turns gray but does not darken like other weather effects. Roads and green grass are covered with snow, and vacant plots adjust grass color accordingly.",
      "descriptionNotes": null,
      "building": null,
      "wikiUrl": null,
      "image": "/Brookhaven%20RP/Weather%20and%20Disasters/snow-on-ground.webp",
      "sourceImageUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/official-brookhaven/images/0/00/WeatherEffect_%281%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20260125123738"
    },
