      "notes": null,
      "description": "Very rarely, earthquakes occur with varying intensity. The player's screen shakes according to the earthquake's magnitude. A warning appears in the right corner of the screen, detailing the earthquake and its size. Some particles may appear if the player owns the Disaster Pack pass.",
